8. release_operator_resource origin_availability_alpha driver_operator_alpha (optional)

9. attach_task_profile destination_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha

10. confirm_candidate_preparedness destination_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha

11. assign_operator_resource destination_availability_alpha driver_operator_alpha

12. activate_destination_node destination_availability_alpha destination_node_alpha route_task_profile_alpha

13. load_destination_payload destination_availability_alpha destination_node_alpha cargo_payload_alpha

14. lock_destination_availability destination_availability_alpha destination_node_alpha driver_operator_alpha

15. (optional) release_operator_resource destination_availability_alpha driver_operator_alpha (not needed)

